  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "The ProcessManager is a critical service layer component responsible for tracking the lifecycle and state persistence of running JARVIS instances. It enforces process exclusivity by utilizing file locking (fcntl.flock) on PID files located in a designated directory. It provides APIs for querying instance status, serializing/deserializing state, and managing the registration and graceful shutdown of local process instances."
  },
